[{"client_msg_id":"A3A0F1C1-58F2-4FD6-961C-8980EC65D029","type":"message","user":"U77U7B85A","text":"Cloud Profilerも便利でした\n\u003chttps://cloud.google.com/profiler|https://cloud.google.com/profiler\u003e","ts":"1618220785.080000","attachments":[{"fallback":"Google Cloud: Cloud Profiler  |  Google Cloud","id":1,"title":"Cloud Profiler  |  Google Cloud","title_link":"https://cloud.google.com/profiler","text":"Cloud Profiler continually analyzes the performance of your code as it executes in production to help improve performance and reduce costs.","image_url":"https://cloud.google.com/_static/cloud/images/social-icon-google-cloud-1200-630.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Google Cloud","service_icon":"https://www.gstatic.com/devrel-devsite/prod/v361636fe9adc09a35d4071cab3bc6a613653d01c6fde907d9b5c606946d81263/cloud/images/favicons/onecloud/super_cloud.png","from_url":"https://cloud.google.com/profiler","original_url":"https://cloud.google.com/profiler"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"heart","count":1,"users":["UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kGRz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e362ef36-6d17-4baa-98ce-ae38510951d8","type":"message","user":"UEACRCY0Z","text":"うちは GCP でサービス動かしているので、プロダクションでも Cloud Monitoring でデータを収集してボトルネック見つけたりしてます\n\u003chttps://cloud.google.com/monitoring\u003e\n\n使ってないけど、OpenTelemetry が業界標準かな？\n\u003chttps://opentelemetry.io/\u003e","ts":"1618206332.078900","attachments":[{"fallback":"Google Cloud: Cloud Monitoring  |  Google Cloud","id":1,"title":"Cloud Monitoring  |  Google Cloud","title_link":"https://cloud.google.com/monitoring","text":"Gain visibility into the performance, uptime, and overall health of cloud-powered apps on Google Cloud and other cloud or on-premises environments.","image_url":"https://cloud.google.com/_static/cloud/images/social-icon-google-cloud-1200-630.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Google Cloud","service_icon":"https://www.gstatic.com/devrel-devsite/prod/v361636fe9adc09a35d4071cab3bc6a613653d01c6fde907d9b5c606946d81263/cloud/images/favicons/onecloud/super_cloud.png","from_url":"https://cloud.google.com/monitoring","original_url":"https://cloud.google.com/monitoring"},{"fallback":"OpenTelemetry","id":2,"title":"OpenTelemetry","title_link":"https://opentelemetry.io/","text":"The OpenTelemetry Project Site","image_url":"https://opentelemetry.io/featured-background.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"opentelemetry.io","from_url":"https://opentelemetry.io/","original_url":"https://opentelemetry.io/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kios8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cda5631e-ebcf-47b6-8d8c-1819aca9765a","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ちょっとスループットとレイテンシについて調べてみます","ts":"1618198381.076500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A/y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"211c70c6-efa4-4ec6-a9f1-b8acb8e713c1","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど","ts":"1618198363.076000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xlnir"}]},{"client_msg_id":"387c61c8-30f2-4601-91e5-ddefe4db3e44","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"すごい雑にいうと、レイテンシはCPUの1コアがどれだけ強いか。スループットはコアがどれだけ多いか\u0026amp;バス帯域とか総合力ってな感じです。\n\nで後者が頑張るとCPU1コアは最高のパフォーマンスは出せない。","ts":"1618197899.075800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fn+F5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a79fe224-ba20-42fc-a8f8-301cd8360cf3","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あー、それもケース・バイ・ケースか","ts":"1618197849.074800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7JFc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19c7cc43-cedc-4181-aead-1e930bd737e2","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"処理できる量が増えるとレイテンシがよくなると思っていました","ts":"1618197828.074300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JXh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b9f8441d-6e90-4258-9cf5-d6994b167db8","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あ、そうなんすか","ts":"1618197780.072900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2F0="}]},{"client_msg_id":"718a7c5e-7544-42b3-abe1-3432836add82","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"スループットとレイテンシは微妙に異なるんですよね。僕が過去にやってきたGoのプロジェクトだと、だいたいスループットを上げるとレイテンシはちょっと悪くなる。","ts":"1618197729.072500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aQqr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5946f5d-489b-4a8f-81d1-15f9d5b3702a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"abつかって100万リクエストを何並列で何秒かかった、req/secはこのくらいとかとか。(スループットの測定)","ts":"1618197678.071700","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1618197759.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ltE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9866b1da-9e96-4b4b-9262-2f5c9a5efb49","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"例えばこのAPIコールが完了するのに平均何秒で偏差(バラツキ)はどのくらい、みたいな。(レイテンシの測定)","ts":"1618197621.070700","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1618197749.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ddh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5cb8e487-14b7-4178-a147-b1f72a74c465","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ですよね","ts":"1618197611.070400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zYo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6f83557-6f3e-4ba5-b321-318fefe21b09","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"そうですね。正確にはプロファイルはどこに問題があるかの確認に頼るのが正しくてマイクロな測定とその改善には使えます。ただ仕事して考えるとサービスとか機能といったマクロなパフォーマンスがどのくらい改善したかはまた別の指標が要るかと思います。","ts":"1618197574.069600","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1618197590.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"or1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4684cefa-7779-4af4-becd-677d57e25b10","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"めっちゃ勉強になりました\n感謝","ts":"1618197412.068100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oey"}]},{"client_msg_id":"07cd7758-d143-4643-bf0f-57993599d0be","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ちゃんとパフォーマンスがどれくらい改善できたかは、サンプルリングじゃなくてきちんと同じ状態で計測は必要、ということですね","ts":"1618197402.067800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z6g6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f89aa823-99f2-4584-8fe2-ad5bf9b118b0","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ありがとうございます\nめっちゃわかりやすかったです","ts":"1618197358.067000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vNvap"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b9802c2-b106-4e30-81ab-42f5bcdfa740","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"それだけ頭に入れておくとよいです。","ts":"1618197348.066700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5NHk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ecf77baa-3c35-4807-90f0-0330afc6d2c8","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど、理解しました","ts":"1618197340.066400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A77dB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d1b412e-76df-42a2-8372-2148688345e1","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"で、Goのpprofに話を戻すと、結果を見る限りあきらかにココがボトルネックなんだけど、コードと対照するとそんなわけないよな～って時にサンプリングによる見逃しが起こってる可能性が高い。","ts":"1618197323.066000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":1,"users":["UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g0qT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c682e4ea-610d-48a7-97c8-2f5c7bbdf354","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど、段々わかってきた気がします","ts":"1618197322.065900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ocpE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"09adc7cb-b13c-45a9-af18-e36a5a8cfcb0","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"そそ。","ts":"1618197273.064700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g0Mr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b8d2baf-5cee-47fb-bbf7-21bcedbe45d4","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"できなくなる = できなくなる可能性がある、が正確な表現か","ts":"1618197267.064500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/IA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"832a68d5-24ba-4cfe-acf2-78bd18c3e28b","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"本来確保できたはずのメモリを確保できなくなるから、本番でのパフォーマンスと同等の状態で計測はできないのか","ts":"1618197213.064000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qw83="}]},{"client_msg_id":"d42432cd-a1b6-4d1c-b085-61ae586e9321","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"最低限だと記録するのは関数ごとに回数とリソース使用総量(累積)で良いはずではあります。","ts":"1618197203.063800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rYf3t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f136d740-90a5-4b1a-b352-c4cd3f834040","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"たしかに","ts":"1618197162.062400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qkI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c2f4c1c-4ff3-43d4-b700-0ac8c77d6233","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"CPUプロファイルも同様ですね。","ts":"1618197152.062100","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1618197157.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UJP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb6a6b47-01a3-493d-a2af-8922505b2b50","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど","ts":"1618197151.062000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sVw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a1bfe046-3d74-4703-84a5-134346d94ed8","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あー","ts":"1618197148.061700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B9av9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"74daee1b-21a6-4e02-9030-b94e1dcceeba","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"それはするはずですが、プロファイルすることで馬鹿みたいにメモリ使用量上がっちゃったら、厳密には本番とは振る舞いが異なっちゃうので、計測の根拠が弱くなっちゃうんです。","ts":"1618197132.061100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KAKB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"251a063f-41c5-4bc9-a82c-c265e347ff41","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"pprofで使ったメモリを引き算してくれないのかな","ts":"1618197018.060200","edited":{"user":"UDDCM376D","ts":"1618197031.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b7D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f68ad0bc-1156-4240-9edc-29ae8259e3c0","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"全部取るには関数ごとというか関数の呼び出しごとに記録していかなきゃなので。","ts":"1618196995.059800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lwsx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"44382230-2d73-4323-bc26-b76899cef10d","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あー、たしかに","ts":"1618196981.059200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hCq=Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f4f10b9-7402-48b5-85ff-8c4c406f340a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"とはいえ関数が増えて全部取っておくとそっちのメモリ/ファイルが圧迫するのは間違いないんですよね。","ts":"1618196969.058900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TZv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e201172-b4b2-4d68-b4d3-fb34b6682253","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"どのみちヒープはとったり開放したりはあるので、そこで統計取ればよい。ただス